"version": "1",
"text": "Your outfit combines a soft mint-green two-piece set with a vintage beige blazer, wrapped in a cashmere scarf and finished with ballet flats and a khaki tote. The mint base brings a fresh, autumnal coolness that suits the park setting, while the beige blazer adds structure and warmth for the cobblestone streets. This mix of relaxed knits and tailored layers keeps you comfortable all day without looking too casual.
",
"how_to_wear": [
"Layer the beige blazer over the mint sweatshirt to create a crisp contrast between soft fabric and sharp tailoring.",
"Drape the cashmere scarf loosely around your neck or shoulders to add warmth and texture against the smooth jacket.",
"Tuck the mint trousers into your ballet flats to keep the silhouette elongated as you walk on uneven surfaces."
],
