"about_items": [
{
"n": "#284·36",
"text": "This mint-green set features an oversized sweatshirt with a chest pocket and relaxed straight-leg trousers. The soft fabric and generous cut offer maximum comfort for long walks, while the matching color creates a seamless, effortless silhouette."
},
{
"n": "#113·37",
"text": "The vintage beige blazer adds structure to your look with its short sleeves, ruffled front detail, and belted waist. The peplum hem flares gently at the hips, creating a defined shape that balances the volume of the loose set underneath."
},
{
"n": "#553·42",
"text": "This cashmere scarf features a neutral beige tone with delicate fringe along the edges. Its soft texture provides warmth without bulk, and its length allows for versatile styling around your neck or draped over your shoulders."
},
{
"n": "#197·33",
"text": "The khaki tote bag offers a spacious, structured design made from durable fabric with a large slip pocket. Its simple shape complements the casual elegance of your outfit while providing practical storage for essentials during your excursion."
},
{
"n": "#452·06",
"text": "These beige suede ballet flats feature a square toe and soft elastic sides for a snug, comfortable fit. Their minimalist design and low profile complete your look without adding unnecessary height or distraction."
}
],
